[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/715610781","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/13277#issuecomment-715610781","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/13277","id":715610781,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxNTYxMDc4MQ==","user":{"login":"gsantner","id":6735650,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzU2NTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6735650?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner","html_url":"https://github.com/gsantner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-23T22:05:42Z","updated_at":"2020-10-23T22:15:25Z","body":"The issue is that gitea now does !!write!! the app.ini config when restarting gitea.\r\n\r\nI saw \r\n\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6735650/97057670-09442e00-158c-11eb-93c0-827edb0b5261.png)\r\n\r\nWrote the [default config](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/blob/master/custom/conf/app.example.ini#L280) value again (checked diff, it was there also before updating gitea)\r\n\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6735650/97057766-43adcb00-158c-11eb-8be3-b9c7cc4ed5bc.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nPressed save, then restart gitea with systemctl:\r\n\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6735650/97057686-1234ff80-158c-11eb-88d6-57c7855cbe0d.png)\r\n\r\nSuddenly vim says file has changed since last write...and wonder..the :9003 value is there again (why gitea rewrites the config file and saves it to disk??)\r\n\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6735650/97057843-7eaffe80-158c-11eb-9862-35bc9621b1d3.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nsystemctl file, pretty standard, always used it in this way:\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6735650/97057892-9e472700-158c-11eb-8aba-f608d53676b7.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nI checked if there would be anything that also would write the app.ini file - there is none. Everything is gitea start command.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen I comment the setting completely I get:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20201024-001239](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6735650/97058327-c84d1900-158d-11eb-9bbb-dab80f4a207c.png)\r\n\r\nNo errors logged to gitea log files.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/715610781/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gsantner","id":6735650,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzU2NTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6735650?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner","html_url":"https://github.com/gsantner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsantner